    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Superligaen i tal\"\njupyter: superliga          # projektets egen Python-kerne (.venv)\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n---\n\n\n\n<!--\n  Fælles indhold for alle sider under \"Superligaen i tal\".\n  Hver side (tal/index.qmd for den igangværende sæson, tal/<sæson>.qmd for tidligere sæsoner)\n  sætter variablen SAESON i en kodecelle og inkluderer derefter denne fil.\n  Kun tal og grafer, ingen fortolkende tekst.\n-->\n\n\n\n<p class=\"tal-status\">Sæson 2026/27 · opdateret efter runde 9</p>\n<p class=\"tal-saesoner\">Sæson: <strong>2026/27</strong> · <a href=\"2025-26.html\">2025/26</a> · <a href=\"2024-25.html\">2024/25</a> · <a href=\"2023-24.html\">2023/24</a> · <a href=\"2022-23.html\">2022/23</a> · <a href=\"2021-22.html\">2021/22</a> · <a href=\"2020-21.html\">2020/21</a></p>\n\n\n## Game states\n\n::: {.column-margin}\n**Game states:** Hvor stor en del af de 90 minutter holdet har været foran, uafgjort og bagud. Mål i tillægstid tæller på periodens sidste minut. Se [metoden](../metode.qmd).\n:::\n\n::: {.column-page-right}\n<picture class=\"graf\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"figurer/2026-27-gamestates-mobil.svg\"><img src=\"figurer/2026-27-gamestates.svg\" alt=\"Andel af spilletiden foran, uafgjort og bagud for hvert hold, Superligaen 2026/27.\" class=\"img-fluid\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture>\n:::\n\n\n## Den alternative tabel\n\n::: {.column-margin}\n**Den alternative tabel:** Placering, hvis alle kampe var stoppet efter 15, 30, 45, 60 eller 75 minutter, og den rigtige placering (90'). Ved stop sorteres efter point; ved 90' også efter målforskel og scorede mål. Hold musen over et tal for at se point.\n:::\n\n<div class=\"tabel-rul\"><table class=\"alt-tabel\"><thead><tr><th class='hold'>Hold</th><th>15'</th><th>30'</th><th>45'</th><th>60'</th><th>75'</th><th>90'</th><th class='point'>Point</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>FC København</span><span class='kort'>FCK</span></td><td title=\"15 point\">1</td><td title=\"17 point\">1</td><td title=\"19 point\">1</td><td title=\"20 point\">1</td><td title=\"22 point\">1</td><td title=\"24 point\">1</td><td class='point'>24</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>FC Midtjylland</span><span class='kort'>FCM</span></td><td title=\"14 point\">2</td><td title=\"16 point\">2</td><td title=\"18 point\">2</td><td title=\"18 point\">2</td><td title=\"18 point\">2</td><td title=\"19 point\">2</td><td class='point'>19</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>Viborg FF</span><span class='kort'>VFF</span></td><td title=\"12 point\">6</td><td title=\"12 point\">5</td><td title=\"13 point\">4</td><td title=\"18 point\">3</td><td title=\"18 point\">3</td><td title=\"17 point\">3</td><td class='point'>17</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>FC Nordsjælland</span><span class='kort'>FCN</span></td><td title=\"10 point\">7</td><td title=\"10 point\">8</td><td title=\"11 point\">5</td><td title=\"11 point\">7</td><td title=\"13 point\">5</td><td title=\"17 point\">4</td><td class='point'>17</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>Brøndby IF</span><span class='kort'>BIF</span></td><td title=\"8 point\">10</td><td title=\"10 point\">7</td><td title=\"9 point\">10</td><td title=\"14 point\">5</td><td title=\"14 point\">4</td><td title=\"13 point\">5</td><td class='point'>13</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>AC Horsens</span><span class='kort'>ACH</span></td><td title=\"7 point\">11</td><td title=\"8 point\">10</td><td title=\"9 point\">9</td><td title=\"8 point\">9</td><td title=\"8 point\">9</td><td title=\"11 point\">6</td><td class='point'>11</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>Silkeborg IF</span><span class='kort'>SIF</span></td><td title=\"12 point\">4</td><td title=\"16 point\">3</td><td title=\"18 point\">3</td><td title=\"15 point\">4</td><td title=\"13 point\">6</td><td title=\"10 point\">7</td><td class='point'>10</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>Randers FC</span><span class='kort'>RFC</span></td><td title=\"14 point\">3</td><td title=\"13 point\">4</td><td title=\"11 point\">8</td><td title=\"12 point\">6</td><td title=\"12 point\">7</td><td title=\"10 point\">8</td><td class='point'>10</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>OB</span><span class='kort'>OB</span></td><td title=\"9 point\">9</td><td title=\"11 point\">6</td><td title=\"11 point\">7</td><td title=\"6 point\">11</td><td title=\"4 point\">12</td><td title=\"9 point\">9</td><td class='point'>9</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>Lyngby BK</span><span class='kort'>LBK</span></td><td title=\"9 point\">8</td><td title=\"8 point\">11</td><td title=\"11 point\">6</td><td title=\"11 point\">8</td><td title=\"10 point\">8</td><td title=\"7 point\">10</td><td class='point'>7</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>AGF</span><span class='kort'>AGF</span></td><td title=\"7 point\">12</td><td title=\"5 point\">12</td><td title=\"7 point\">11</td><td title=\"7 point\">10</td><td title=\"6 point\">10</td><td title=\"5 point\">11</td><td class='point'>5</td></tr><tr><td class='hold'><span class='lang'>Sønderjyske</span><span class='kort'>SJF</span></td><td title=\"12 point\">5</td><td title=\"9 point\">9</td><td title=\"6 point\">12</td><td title=\"6 point\">12</td><td title=\"6 point\">11</td><td title=\"5 point\">12</td><td class='point'>5</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n\n## Comebacks og føringer\n\n::: {.column-margin}\n**Point hentet fra bagud:** point i kampe, hvor holdet på et tidspunkt var bagud. **Point tabt fra føring:** 3 minus point i kampe, hvor holdet på et tidspunkt var foran.\n:::\n\n::: {.column-page-right}\n<picture class=\"graf\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"figurer/2026-27-comebacks-mobil.svg\"><img src=\"figurer/2026-27-comebacks.svg\" alt=\"Point hentet fra bagud og tabt fra føring for hvert hold, Superligaen 2026/27.\" class=\"img-fluid\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture>\n:::\n\n\n## Scoringstidspunkter\n\n::: {.column-margin}\n**Intervaller:** 0–15, 16–30, 31–45+ (inkl. tillægstid i 1. halvleg), 46–60, 61–75 og 76–90+ (inkl. tillægstid). Tal i parentes er mål i alt.\n:::\n\n::: {.column-page-right}\n<picture class=\"graf\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"figurer/2026-27-scoret-mobil.svg\"><img src=\"figurer/2026-27-scoret.svg\" alt=\"Mål scoret pr. 15-minutters interval for hvert hold, Superligaen 2026/27.\" class=\"img-fluid\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture>\n:::\n\n::: {.column-page-right}\n<picture class=\"graf\"><source media=\"(max-width: 600px)\" srcset=\"figurer/2026-27-indkasseret-mobil.svg\"><img src=\"figurer/2026-27-indkasseret.svg\" alt=\"Mål indkasseret pr. 15-minutters interval for hvert hold, Superligaen 2026/27.\" class=\"img-fluid\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture>\n:::\n\n\n\n",
